              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyaka tagitera kurabanganayo kulemwa akagiita. Namanya okwo aratera emyakaye narabyamu egali, kyonkai yonene emyakaye atagiisire. ",
          "type": "text",
